{code:java}
Request.addCompletionListener(servletContextRequest, servletChannel::recycle);
{code}

Hello team, I just discovered that PutSyslog processor routes messages with Z timezone to invalid relationship.

 

Setting up sample PutSyslog processor with (format taken from NiFi documentation)
{code:java}
Message Timestamp: ${now():format("yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SZ")} 

{code}
 

Same problem applies also to format yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssZ

The +hh:mm form does not have the problem.

 

 

Other parameters are fixed
{code:java}
Message Priority: 1
Message Hostname: example.com
Message Body: message

{code}

