{color:#067d17}"awsTaskId"{color}, to -> {color:#067d17}"${{color}{color:#0037a6}"{color}{color:#067d17}AWS Task ID{color}{color:#0037a6}"}{color}" {color:#172b4d}in order to make the getter processor work without any change.{color}

