Currently the {{LineageRequestDTO}} documents the Event ID as being ignored if the Lineage Request Type is FLOWFILE and the UUID is provided:
{code:java}
[user](description = """
                The event id that was used to generate this lineage, if applicable.
                The event id is allowed for any type of lineageRequestType.
